# Build context for super-admin/Dockerfile.
#
# Docker reads the .dockerignore at the root of the build CONTEXT, and
# Coolify builds this app with `super-admin` as its base directory, so this
# is the file that applies.
#
# Effect: 714MB context down to ~436KB.

node_modules
.next
out

# Never let a local env file reach a build layer. Everything this app needs is
# passed as a build ARG, and a .env copied in here would both override those
# and persist in the image history where `docker history` can read it.
.env
.env.*

.git
.gitignore
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
